# Guess-It-1 (Python Solution)

A real-time predictive streaming application built in Python that utilizes statistical analysis (moving averages and standard deviation) to forecast numerical sequences.

---

## 📋 Overview

The **`guess-it-1`** project acts as a real-time stream processor. It reads numbers sequentially from standard input (`sys.stdin`), updates an adaptive statistical model, and immediately outputs a predicted range (lower and upper limits) for the next incoming value.

---

## 🛠️ Project Structure

Ensure your project directory is organized as follows:

```text
guess-it/
│
├── student/
│   └── solution.py       # Your core Python prediction script
├── script.sh             # Executable shell runner script at the root
└── README.md             # Project documentation